		(descr "DDR5 UDIMM 288-pin 0.85 mm vertical SMT socket, UMAX 90414 series (drawing C-90414 rev 3): body 141.7 x 6.30, height 21.3, seating plane <= 2.0. Short latch: closed 142.0, open 151.5, keep-out 152.0 (Dwgs). LCSC stocks the long-latch C2922443 (90414-15011-21, closed 147.5) - order the short-latch code. Pads per drawing detail A (0.52 x 2.05), rows +-1.5.")
